            "start": "01:56.90",
            "end": "01:59.50",
            "character": "JULIANA",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "...but you have never learned how to make anyone love you."
          },
          {
            "start": "01:59.60",
            "end": "02:01.80",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Silence! Silence!"
          },
          {
            "start": "02:01.80",
            "end": "02:02.80",
            "character": "CATHERINE",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Why?!"
          },
          {
            "start": "02:03.00",
            "end": "02:05.20",
            "character": "JULIANA",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "Because I am right!"
          },
          {
            "start": "02:05.40",
            "end": "02:08.80",
            "character": "JULIANA",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "You want everyone to believe you are powerful."
          },
          {
            "start": "02:09.00",
            "end": "02:11.60",
            "character": "JULIANA",
            "kind": "dialogue",
            "text": "You want everyone to fear you."
